        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=BT7-029#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT7-029 (Mar. 28, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "It means the effect can be activated both [When Digivolving] and [When Attacking].  You can activate it as a [When Digivolving] effect when you digivolve this Digimon, then activate it again on following turns as a [When Attacking] effect by attacking with this Digimon.",
        "question": "This card has an effect that activates at both [When Digivolving] and [When Attacking] timings. What does this mean, exactly?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No. No matter which timing the effect is triggered at, it is still the same effect and can only be activated [Once Per Turn]. If the effect has been triggered at [When Digivolving] and activated, it can not be activated again on the same turn, even if it's triggered [When Attacking].",
        "question": "This card has a [When Digivolving][When Attacking][Once Per Turn] effect, but can I activate it twice in the same turn by both digivolving and attacking?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
